{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the largest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/d/0ed680ca2df33d8d69631ff1e8e6a3ce70f408e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^{1024}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/481930a776b68fba6d9c8d42e42838298f6e03d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 1\\qquad \\text{(B) } 2\\qquad \\text{(C) } 3\\qquad \\text{(D) } 4\\qquad \\text{(E) } 5\\qquad \\text{(F) } 6\\qquad \\text{(G) } 7\\qquad \\text{(H) } 8\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"548\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a4c810aab325f6e84b17bbe6ed40b2380966916.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(I) } 9\\qquad \\text{(J) } 10\\qquad \\text{(K) } 11\\qquad \\text{(L) } 12\\qquad \\text{(M) } 13\\qquad \\text{(N) } 14\\qquad \\text{(O) } 15\\qquad \\text{(P) } 16\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"605\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/3/7e31f65d047b89efa667eda349f42d4c4d4be817.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(Q) } 55\\qquad \\text{(R) } 63\\qquad \\text{(S) } 64\\qquad \\text{(T) } 2007\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"310\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression can be factored by repeatedly using the difference of squares.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3e2fd6af366512242959522a0c3bbaf871ac90c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2007^{512} + 1)(2007^{512} - 1)\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca4e9854f75e4298c01d3946445efc91640d5f4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2007^{512} + 1)(2007^{256} + 1)(2007^{256} - 1)\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/ceaaef92471d1811455d0a7ad94af9c831dd0c54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2007^{512} + 1)(2007^{256} + 1) \\cdots (2007^1 + 1)(2007^1 - 1)\\]\" width=\"407\" height=\"19\" />\nNotice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/752a205665eef32b4bdc6ec482a1b49abab8cd91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007 \\equiv 3 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/f/12f7f6cc1e1568b2e4ba63ef135c4498db8cc715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^2 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"19\" />.  Thus, in the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb0409496529b13440a10b4a370aeaec36eb988.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^a + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is even, then the expression is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modulo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modulo\">modulo</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThe remaining numbers to consider are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.  Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/b/eeba3b6274ab39bb6a9d031e7660491d437395f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 251$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, and factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea0b00ae88fe04e02017246e9906547dd5736db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 1003$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThat means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b8188fdef11788dfb40f5b6404e65bf2a10c020a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^{1004} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/582a25403ef4700b1bdcc2d128ae1b64f922d96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+3+1 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" /> as the exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b8188fdef11788dfb40f5b6404e65bf2a10c020a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^{1004} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9b6ce4c855c8df71f8e412df968ee2b67d5d229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(M) } 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lifting the exponent when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e129fbcb9c592946641c11f0c3eb03a078b4bdf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> says that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74b97d60c29a8a3e4cd42a2fe04ac8550d7f96bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(x^n - y^n) = v_2(\\frac{x^2 - y^2}{2}) + v_2(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"272\" height=\"41\" />. Thus, one can see that we rewrite as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23d0a4bce07411cbfe56b28d3107d015dc40f3f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007^{1024} - 1^{1024}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />, and lifting the exponent gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bf0d4e5eb6ec7d038d0bac65e253e09a92207eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(2007^{1024} - 1^{1024}) = v_2(\\frac{2007^2 - 1^2}{2}) + v_2(1024)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"41\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17daa6c092378804e901deb2b9a1b93018686f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(1024) = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />, and thus we just need to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad35c61abfaa4ce09f971691b0a565887dbd00c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(\\frac{2007^2 - 1^2}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"41\" />. Note that this is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4d424c0790d1950d7811b52fefb06013886d363.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(\\frac{(2006)(2008)}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"137\" height=\"40\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb33e2785941b0c600ce83a2b2c15c2fbed05b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2((1003)(2008))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />. Note that 8 divides 2008 but 16 doesn't, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7ddb3167e25cad292ca8a19375d62bdebb53640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2((1003)(2008)) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />. The suggested answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25e40bc2b9bcef49b195e9be1e88febb6eff5fd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <